flowchart LR
    subgraph Phase 1 ["Phase 1: Origination"]
        A1[Asset Owner<br/>submits asset] --> A2[Asset Metadata<br/>+ Legal Docs]
        A2 --> A3[Upload to IPFS<br/>Hash on-chain]
    end

    subgraph Phase 2 ["Phase 2: Verification"]
        B1[Asset Verifiers<br/>Staked in ESVL] --> B2[Due Diligence<br/>Legal + Physical + Valuation]
        B2 --> B3{Consensus<br/>≥ 67% Approval}
        B3 -->|Rejected| B4[Return to Originator]
        B3 -->|Approved| B5[Governance Council<br/>Final Sign-off]
    end

    subgraph Phase 3 ["Phase 3: Tokenization"]
        C1[ComplianceFacet<br/>zk-KYC Check] --> C2[TokenizationFacet<br/>Mint E-RWA Tokens]
        C2 --> C3[Partition Tokens<br/>ERC-1410 Tranches]
        C3 --> C4[Class A: Ownership + Voting<br/>Class B: Access / Yield<br/>Class C: Tradeable]
    end

    subgraph Phase 4 ["Phase 4: Distribution"]
        D1[Primary Offering<br/>Fixed Price / Dutch Auction] --> D2[AMM Pool Creation<br/>Secondary Market]
        D2 --> D3[Revenue Epochs<br/>Yield to Holders]
    end

    A3 --> B1
    B5 --> C1
    C4 --> D1

    style B3 fill:#1A1A1A,stroke:#fff,color:#fff
    style C2 fill:#2D2D2D,stroke:#fff,color:#fff
    style D2 fill:#4A4A4A,stroke:#fff,color:#fff
